				<r3d:description language="eng">The Catalog of Inferred Sequence Binding Preferences (CIS-BP) is a library of transcription factor (TF) DNA binding motifs and specificities. The data are organized in a user friendly manner for ease of searching, browsing, and downloading. CIS-BP also includes built-in web tools for scanning DNA sequences for putative TF binding sites, predicting the DNA binding motif of a given TF, and identifying a TF that might recognize a given DNA motif.</r3d:description>
